{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1540,
  "batch_count": 1711,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d25ece0757aaa73613c5e413f9fcfb8770c034dd",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9f306bbc32fb524bd5f9185",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我明白，品格是自然而然流露出来的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9ed287dc90593863dfa3508928deae027caa3da1b0f0188587755ef26a58f37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dbf6c8ab1c6b112b1112be3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有这样的衣服啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72980ab1493db3e2ce5f14faec482b4affff65ebdd7ccf206e1a5791f305337e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe954c796dead780ed84dfb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时，都想穿着与场合相称的衣装。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e93cab4ddcd31eb368ef4d5f49407c5f15b6a2aa593f51a3eb83c53426ae7e49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f10c69e03ff329b64230bf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e4569b3e376977cf7f785a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来进行一场配得上最强的较量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3583b6dbd9e8eba0064debb6ef6ace4359dc6461e650f976324ee70628fc8bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:861407da67958ffb0ba2886a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很强――但是，\r\n赌上家族的骄傲，\r\n我接受挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa6642efb5973dc7cf94ec4177aff2ba4c52643adeb57a2d0261bb65cec160bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1dc7af77e5b494ceb8b35ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早晨经常做冰沙。\r\n能一次摄取营养……就算\r\n有些不合口味，也能喝下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ced22b9b745973be7827439a1b43083088f6dea6c4662632ad97064939cd998",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4594da0dd36924204294aaa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "清晨跑步时，一定能看到\r\n学园里的某个人在努力。……斗志\r\n也与朝阳一同升起。可不能输啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd91c729cd9086aae5aee407a95dac72c95a526a1c8073390d86bf899cc934bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cd0efb0d2056362843ef6ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在自助餐厅，能度过有意义的\r\n时光。刚才也听见有人分享\r\n新款蛋白粉的使用体验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8677bccc0bb58dc77352446048165ca71ac6d9f6c3ae87fc955d52a2530b6e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:660943a71d1d6f7d94393529",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上课时，我会叫醒睡着的同学。\r\n因为困意，错过宝贵的学习机会\r\n实在太可惜了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcddb555d671048cbcc5e4baa67819bc1d3dca25a1c3d632839091bc4179c27e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0208a74c9b8ae939df7b0f2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会仔细做完拉伸\r\n再入睡。特别是，腿部……\r\n为了明天，也能尽情奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "366de4810f1a9f019272b6bc4b16e9372c84bde684eef3ae7477bb87a4a329f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:385e4afa8921e701fb1f72c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了优质睡眠，睡前会\r\n戴耳机听古典音乐。\r\n……偶尔，会忘记关直到天亮……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fe9a80040d6fe68e14ab72b9bddcbe322547041211091193e9dcdc4a93687ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12c283c5b132cd56c5752e5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "选拔赛的季节到了。\r\n今年出众者的传闻我已经听说……\r\n我也，不能输。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aa3237a7c8ee4f42a9d88c519c88aee075c72024ac838531f208c8d067c7c64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07481a0745e58afe7ff26500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不适合奔跑的，这个季节\r\n原本不喜欢……但也是祭典的季节。\r\n小北的话，让我改变了看法",
      "source_fingerprint": "070a80c871dbbfdbb8e316eff3c4bee1cf3cdbc797306d79138103528e73a615",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc30dfdcceccf04f12f4a501",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "通过阅读增长知识，以艺术提升\r\n修养。……积蓄也是重要的\r\n时光。并非只有焦躁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "346a5d63b1975f49ce7fcb0a003e76c51ae9cda5780241038f87305fd9781c0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27651263967712c43032add7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天肌肉容易僵硬。今年也去\r\n温泉吧……泡完后打乒乓球\r\n再泡一次，这样重复3组",
      "source_fingerprint": "90a3c271240a2123383a2b3bf87d8c25aa55cb81ffdea756043a42e1eae52394",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45f0c3b00a41b68d966835b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "德古拉好像害怕阳光，\r\n但那样一来早上的训练就……\r\n真能达到最强之境吗，那样……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e454339765552e013b84bc33629f3f0d64760c20e02702dc92b60ad11b7e6b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f4e34652973619c7408ac13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上我常和皇冠一起吃水煮蛋\r\n皇冠有各个国家的调味料，\r\n怎么吃都不会腻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b0db4b672587049caa15c99e27f135ef834a1e593967abb29bf9c7d61f3d5e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b12ae2288b8ad374f17d493",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秘诀在于先温热茶杯。\r\n泡得不错的大吉岭红茶……气槽姐和\r\n爱律前辈，会喜欢吗",
      "source_fingerprint": "d76aa1b8c838546ebbe63af584fa4af046d158564beb9f62f86e7d8e4c69e0e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e59a02ed81dbf52ca6761090",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以红色蔬菜为主的果蔬汁，我也经常\r\n会喝……但最近，我在喝的时候\r\n总会有其他孩子被吓一跳……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff7cab5e564dc0c0872aaa6e4ae0f67b96c71211a42aa5a86315ba3c22580280",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e48321ce188089f87f0263d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "健身房的训练，留到最后的\r\n是我和玫瑰。虽然没有\r\n交谈……但总觉得受到了鼓舞呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91dc422cf003425e55bafeab05ce0f5e7fb45cd8f8ecdecdccb5c6da80e2f20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9360f707fa39cf33e118862f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我从图书室借了关于德古拉的\r\n书。到了晚上，那个……\r\n我都在一点一点地读。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7b68533e118b84924330495ee1626405de52385b4a1d1c731ac3e1be34afad0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4faeda9efd44f20989728656",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍的迎新活动要举办运动会\r\n呢。我不会让新生背上心理负担\r\n……所有项目，都由我引向胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "296440d603c130a6bb9386d54052cb87a00937a299c28aca9649e8954086e917",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c97c3db360dcf57f3cc0dfd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在沙滩上和皇冠她们比试了堆沙堡\r\n……沙堡还真是深奥啊。\r\n下次要堆得更巨大……更接近最强……",
      "source_fingerprint": "10f32b75b60c7fc23ae5ca583841fb4d58f011c1a52bd0c6d9d8d6c1d6b68204",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05fb25cfa95192ff056b68c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟光钻说想去法国看看，\r\n她就表示愿意为我做向导。\r\n……我也得提前稍微做点功课才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad02a20d2fea34d7a3711eea78c279fa6f9736cd687da9edd15a3c66bf3fef85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a5be1677d0fed1ce5c25049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "积雪的树木……那是背负着诸多\r\n心意依然傲然挺立的强大象征。\r\n……我也必须像那样，凛然伫立才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "014048489a7757616f1ed5d0b7a9333dab317dee317b6680da057a7be92cc564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f0e6b2ec7a09b048f06ef43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是情人节，啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed53321d143ea8fb24a4d3f7a7377598b151ac46f844792fce69994f666e21d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:877e1416a30a449aaf67cd69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是情人节，呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "256af17b09fa41088a27a0adc662595ccb7836286dee381a2a4efce0182e12f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58610aa520442214d2b4cdbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢气槽姐的花坛。\r\n因为她看着植物生长时，\r\n脸上的神情真的很温柔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48957c1843335f804b26d40bb294c0a47bf62adfb76d3c4fcff4cf44446d68e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553a4c4a65ed0bcf446c9683",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏皇冠，英语学习\r\n十分顺利。我想更加努力\r\n做到像她那样，自信地开口。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1dc2b812ae1cff5e3e860e7a34040c0e8e1d92fd036df54d2440f87614fc8d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aca9962d805ab45a1833e5d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "川上从天上掉下来了。\r\n原因完全不明……\r\n幸好，接住了她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "425bb70d706a4f80d53748a3eaad83b53de3039ca655f5148e3e8e5d3b5c6b49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47332d7f12ffdb3c41febbf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火山向我推荐了，一种名叫\r\n蓝靛果的东西。还附上了营养\r\n资料……真是准备周全。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b41ada0dac58cbc13ee3818d1adecea783890283b48921a0fb2f044ea2a11b1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e672fa1beb1816a3a11a9b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就连现在，回过神来\r\n脑海里也浮现出草地赛道。\r\n该如何超越眼前的赛马娘……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebd5df8145ed94927f08e3ca8356f61246581723c987469e86629f9c4ac7aee7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26dab5493eb037db52fe3989",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "粉丝的支持会化为力量……\r\n如今我，切实体会到了这句话。\r\n想将感激融入指尖，舞动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45b45f0ce5bac07663e546ee54fd47d5f85c23e4952e44e22853e45b48baa025",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edd7c731d566df254b10ed8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身衣装很华美。虽不常穿白色，\r\n但它给人纯净明亮的印象。\r\n……偶尔穿穿，也不坏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95f9f44dc82093e4a362df3a21498dbddfab6333421227b3ad669d2b7f02bd01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:088b841549447c8a0494b775",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肩上的羽毛，寄托着飞翔的心愿――借用了\r\n气槽姐的设计。为了让我也成为\r\n兼具品位和力量的赛马娘，像她一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1e673e29aa429a06568515efe98bd81f2cf1d53d6010c26415b9b744faf5616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f16f7ef1fbd5ee4728b2d5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "靴子的设计，蕴含意义。\r\n力量，以及羁绊――都是我重视的事物",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d19eb6673dd494e2d5f83557b38361a625a9f0daa2b7e4e7fc7e1b614e6adca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7036d14fae9c382a2da3f7d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早晨。……皇冠，有时会\r\n睡眼惺忪地，对我说这句粤语\r\n意思是早安……我好奇便查了一下",
      "source_fingerprint": "926d62f5f169f207549cbcbdf33bcbbc994ff4040425cd9824e66023a91e2071",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:942f68996597e42096bcfa9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛理论的报告，写不进规定页数\r\n里……。关于发动进攻的时机，\r\n我还有很多想讨论……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaf46e15b2651cc6f6996d389e5281fc19f0b8caf1e836574d83f0d9f7bc3335",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14897c39d84a0761e54e78a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来进行一场配得上最强的较量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3583b6dbd9e8eba0064debb6ef6ace4359dc6461e650f976324ee70628fc8bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a74d1aa42f66db331519f49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一天结束时，反省自己。\r\n是否做到完美，是否有所遗漏\r\n――是否做到了无愧于这血脉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a5256ef00da9fef9036bc2a1d7373e5c4b66497eed684647ec9e41ab86eb833",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c344a9a9a06201f213d5f82c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我去看了进入本格化时期的赛马娘们\r\n的亮相会。――我也\r\n曾那么，青涩吗",
      "source_fingerprint": "b856efe98ef31b8f376665c1a434974c0bf34d3acaa77da90373cc536c17efe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f029d4c047a58875f59b0ff6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想去高原训练。\r\n凉爽，负荷也高――\r\n山顶的，风景也不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04834caa798290bc2e5e1898c6c7fdfc5cfaf00109bf1b7fca6d1516cec506fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b084ee9afddac2f97a875f62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "令人感伤的季节――原因，\r\n虽不明白……可一旦闲下来，\r\n心里就莫名躁动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "515382d2ab1c8fcbb9526dd2a854f18c5ad15cb8a2e8f7ef83bdc5c2da4a9e44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12fe8aa36e4f548100e4f093",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和姐姐们堆雪人时，是在比赛。\r\n看谁能做出最大的雪球\r\n……要把它们叠起来可费了不少力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dcc3744cbdad8c37b90e72a8fd8c06a9aa5f259805e2d23820d200a4c2d93ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b07fa21be108a10b33d7c77c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束后，当我望向你的\r\n训练员室时，看到了亮着的灯光\r\n……让我切身感受到我们正并肩同行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f20b5e48c2dd5f6740f992e8188a53155ddf9bd1dd9707598d0f8973e191dba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7bd3dffa10c3c10441150bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爱律前辈她，正沉浸在某种思索\r\n之中。我该不该……上前搭话呢。\r\n会不会打扰到她呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cb4280eea0358f14776f3c1c80ff1e87cdad8fece0d5fd376f9279431b84af1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80dc214d3e133a20d8945c3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我偶尔会看领衔的对练\r\n动作比上次看到时更加利落了\r\n……我也必须，更加勤勉才行啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6662a61082119290035ad58adbfbef35f5eed93eef7a0c33e48d885cdd7dd4da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c54b9660b10c0adc3e9de57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在国际象棋上赢过统治了。\r\n……不过，那是屡次挑战后才拿下的胜利。\r\n我也必须，多加磨炼才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20e4ce954d82b6d32b4d68fe01649e1b9a5c47d0680c9e459010c7d9f150326d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecb4c7b9aaab1df1f86c2454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我之前和标志一起，参观了传统的\r\n建筑物。守护代代传承至今的历史……\r\n让我再一次，感到了肩头沉甸甸的责任",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a536c37a04f92a1a1b0549bf30be074fa512a2e19ef7b7bdde1bfe737e61ff0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28c2569afc3b3c2bb06bc82e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "复习昨天的内容并预习今天的功课。\r\n早起也是为了这个。\r\n身为最强之人，必须文武双全才行",
      "source_fingerprint": "73e5db93359e37469933d31812258eba4c91b54fcbd5ab7c11cb22ecae3e645a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:000f3331ca8dd060a1abe0aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "浮标钓、洞钓、轻抛钓\r\n都是我和小高尚去日间垂钓时\r\n听说的技法。真是门深奥的学问啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9c4f80ec2e250d2202d0621dae6f4f3e32093934e76fc97f720ee440c9df824",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49a13fbb7d54fc654eb96887",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在就寝前，我一定会彻底做完\r\n拉伸和瑜伽。我想直到一天的\r\n最后一刻都竭尽全力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ebb3ca306463bf996e0fb15130fc4133c06b255bb0c8ec2c715a469f85143f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:751dfb6eaf32306707580868",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新生们，都在努力刻苦训练呢。\r\n……正如家族的先辈们曾为我所做的那样，\r\n我也想展现出身为强者的典范。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cec2ba05022bac3267f09a6f8179a08386d1720483b5ba0a84ed0fff5b54ca5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c909f4dfb8ffcac33242d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜托了。为了夺取胜利的计策，\r\n请和我一起想想吧。\r\n……宿舍里，要举办试胆大会了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "540760e2258e34e63546b8bd092e13bf5b64c4f560dc6a313f91f90f60c263a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cec1f56d729c91a07811b78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋，吗。\r\n在学园里大家，也都开心地这么说着。\r\n……下次我也，试着用用看可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cfba814e6cf420f6352fe52d712fcd945ff1d2235eb29ff9b674572fb48fc2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb69e0e3efa19d3afc16c60a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火锅很好。一次能摄取多种食材，\r\n营养价值也很高。……若是和谁围坐共食，\r\n还能促成有意义的交流。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76cfae0ea46874e88ab04e13246fd21ae4e708c7dc1e4acc949ef00c4532d603",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93bf92f395cfc2701c5b1483",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "德古拉在夜晚拥有无可匹敌的\r\n强大。但我连在白昼也要变得强大，\r\n定要向着真正的最强迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7570e24791d3abd9a52705aee0875ad6f647d501b5bc0e447820aaa1bf40017c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c469817e1fc8b4e2a215c63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身衣服我经常穿在身上。\r\n因为这是气槽姐和爱律前辈一起\r\n帮我挑选的……珍贵之物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2a7156f1d540df81720155310eba03a0a9956f981a0b1b74b5ff0019da2280e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7954f0f02cfcbefd3302f9e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。\r\n――为了比任何人都强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbd61b0a38a3e047a30eb5eda97782e50e04451513331d1c62673453dd5da26a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c488ea7748569ee54ccf80ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夺取胜利――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82049353eca0dfc1f90b7925b12b6ab1eb8440f3967059bd0a11fb6399279dab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71e66abc5012fdef5e63bc5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "通向最强的道路已经清晰可见。\r\n接下来，只需脚踏实地\r\n一步步走下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e1007444878b89ae87cebe3cf8bb32666bcb3573670d763217791fb59b959d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b92e3e8f209d9d6a8b14d0fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经提前确认过赛道的情况。\r\n只要得到指示，\r\n就能立即跑起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b09520db443214f5784869461f11113022cf034de59918af0695ed682a3cf05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee7ed531c91becaf2f77283f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……似乎有几个人，停下脚步\r\n在看这边。――我不打算\r\n隐藏力量。开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a07d929c22fb576869e5e266e13007b9ffa8d15f338579c70719e1b5f6132b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81743ca4a4893700ed0d1dbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "丰富的知识与，那份毅力……\r\n如果你是赛马娘，一定会成为\r\n我的强劲对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af2b1b6cfae14737e4d44cc2bebd6a0d28c71dd03f9ba13059db735065b11f5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd1efa4f355a8e273a4aa667",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你，有擅长的运动吗？\r\n……一起跑步虽难做到，不过\r\n若有能一起投入的运动就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7afb2b22c04a58a7568d0fe910018bb2f672cbccef8713aac2468a0892364aa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcf2c794e152682d62b6bd80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……或许已经成为某种习惯了。\r\n熟悉了这样的光景，自主训练时也，\r\n会叫起不在身边的你……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d556e2d716e869e28539afa17bc426d218dc22ad3862f724b2bf82cd651854b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d71dc260780c0690cf488ef5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在沙滩上高效训练的方法\r\n我已经记下。为了，尽可能吸收\r\n你安排的训练内容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b63c2d718aaf2938a1b9b4546c24578a5abbe3f8bb5518443fb731edca20d52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e83d8779fc81f0028b5bd9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有后辈向我请求说『请收我为眷属吧』\r\n但我该怎么做呢……\r\n对她进行指导就行了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc676d16e45a7e7c3f5c0fdd00022fca4a8efcfd23d89ea888ffdf3cc3900234",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:506b8ea5901d25a1226ab925",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我所统御的，并非只有黑夜。\r\n赛场亦当由我统御，\r\n我必须证明这一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84676f06e3df256b123f317594274a97d5719916770924bee25835366aa5f0ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:493e362134385c8f47b9fa4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "体内流淌的血在躁动。呼唤着要我成为最强。\r\n……为我布置吧。\r\n足以满足这腔热血的，训练内容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ef32a4fa1a41468c50cff50101c1fbba9a20773457f04a1cf72a8069af7de29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f20b768b832229a81bd46b1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仅仅只是强大，还远远不够。\r\n我的目标是高贵、凛然……\r\n唯有能深深吸引人心，才称得上是最强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d6cb5f3ab2a79ea0b33b8d85774a311a57f43eec513a7a1712a796aded1953e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a732c402a1aadfa57465b06a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果你有什么害怕的事物请告诉我。\r\n我想助你一臂之力去克服它。\r\n……哪怕是幽灵之类的，也没关系。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd3a6c858ce8e0e30ce301ecd3e0c3d3ca08cf617829e2115cbbb7ad581d6e9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b18281d4b72f8d3dff32d0e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想让自己的举止更加优雅洗练。\r\n……好让站在我身旁的你，\r\n能够为我感到自豪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f5ffda362e5fd424656bce38cf080a47af6879fae387b8e55e9ccb81da3001",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ec4a0c0b5483c18654b809e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在宁静的夜晚，我会想起你的声音。\r\n……想着明天也要继续努力，\r\n体内便会涌现出力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39bfc7297f2fbbe89c40cfc721261c91a98f95bf2733190a86402d2cb7967c34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dca329c65721b28379f894d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想向家族夸耀。这个成绩，以及你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3b3e7d1788ca4ff0b5bcebf02a28fb419e75a7ecc4b00cce589f68201d23171",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85b01b3eab897640bb78d918",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是与你一同刻下的功绩。……谢谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c3261c77836ab4a192b7c64de5db96725b4624a1adcee4acb61c22271d344fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e544e70f5c5597875453ff7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从今往后，纵有万千长夜……只要与你同行就能跨越。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aae4eccb3663a59cda353308f97562770383dfc1136a9353840eccbfd1cff73c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c0ab23e9a62a81342a37fe3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连你的心也被我吸引了吗。……太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d06ebcfed04e40a984bd0cf72b3d966c2e4840e28176c3cb65a8b35a821a42b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47b61904249ceecd3dabebf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说收集照片的话，谢礼也会增加。嗯……\r\n下一场比赛，我想让你来为我拍。我必将拿下胜利。",
